# Native reader and ordered regions

All exact SUM/count checks passed on 15 sampled corpus columns and 36 controlled region timing cells.

Container descriptors add 10.44% to pooled existing page bytes. Median reader initialization is 0.150 ms per sampled column, including checksum, description parsing, dictionary-order verification, and fact reconstruction. Initialization is measured once per column and is not a repeated benchmark.

| Pages | Selectivity | Candidate pages | Speedup over original Facts | Facts / same regional shortcuts |
